"At the top is the strategist's order. Run along the green arrows: you sprint on the route. Capture the point — stay near the beacon.":"顶部是 AI 战略官的命令。沿绿色箭头跑：在路线上你会冲刺。占领据点——待在信标附近。",
"In strategy the Curator helps you: the box at the top says what to do, a frame shows the button, a ring marks the spot on the map. Complete three of its tips.":"在战略模式中向导会帮助你：顶部的框告诉你做什么，边框标出按钮，圆环标出地图上的位置。完成向导的三条提示。",
