"Autonomous combat vehicle: cannon and MG, barrage, smoke, overdrive.":"自主作战车辆：火炮和机枪、齐射、烟雾、超速。",
"Shooter v6.1":"射手 v6.1",
"Order a \"Tank\" in the factory panel.":"在机械厂面板里训练「坦克」。",
"Jetpacks II and Sky troopers (jetpack elite). Requires a Mech factory, unlocks at 6:00.":"喷气背包 II 与天空士兵（喷气背包精英）。需要机械厂，6:00 解锁。",
"Jetpacks and aircraft unlock later — time to set up anti-air and turrets. Build Barracks and a Mech factory meanwhile.":"喷气背包和飞行器稍后解锁——正好布置防空和炮塔。期间先建造兵营和机械厂。",
"build a Mech factory ⚙ — tanks and vehicles":"建造机械厂 ⚙——坦克和载具",
"Like in StarCraft: the HQ and outposts make only builders. A builder builds Barracks ⚔ (infantry) → Mech factory ⚙ (vehicles) and Drone hub → Airdock ✈ (jetpacks, from 6:00).":"和《星际争霸》一样：总部和前哨只生产工程兵。工程兵建造兵营 ⚔（步兵）→ 机械厂 ⚙（载具）和无人机中心 → 空港 ✈（喷气背包，6:00 起）。",
"capture points — they pay income":"占领据点以获得收入",
"Tanks and vehicles. Requires Barracks.":"坦克和载具。需要兵营。",
"The Airdock is unlocked: Jetpacks II and sky troopers.":"空港已解锁：喷气背包 II 和空降兵。",
"Like StarCraft 2: the HQ and outposts make only builders. Infantry comes from the Barracks, vehicles from the Mech factory, drones from the Drone hub, jetpacks and sky troopers from the Airdock (from 6:00). The Swarm plays by the same rules":"和《星际争霸2》一样：总部和前哨只生产工程兵。步兵来自兵营，载具来自机械工厂，无人机来自无人机枢纽，喷气背包兵和空降兵来自空港（6:00 起）。蜂群遵循同样的规则",
"Strategist: {0} — {1}":"战略官：{0}——{1}",
"Your whole army is at the base, one of each: sky troopers, heavy gunner, sniper, scout, drone, raider, MLRS and mortar. Possess anyone (Tab → select → ▶ Possess).":"全部兵力都在基地，每种一个：空降士兵、重机枪手、狙击手、侦察兵、无人机、突袭者、火箭炮和迫击炮。可附身任意单位（Tab → 选择 → ▶ 附身）。",
"Outpost{0}: {1} ready":"前哨{0}：{1}已就绪",
