"Training ×4: separate step-by-step \"Strategy\" and \"Shooter\" lessons for PC and for phone. A safe sandbox with dummies, the right button highlighted, arrows, animated keys, mouse and gestures; a step counts only for the real action, \"repeat step\", progress at the top and a reward at the end":"训练 ×4：为电脑和手机分别提供分步的“策略”和“射手”课程。带靶子的安全沙盒，高亮正确按钮、箭头、动画按键、鼠标和手势；只有完成真实操作才算一步，可“重复步骤”，顶部显示进度，结束时有奖励",
"Lite mode for weak phones: lower resolution, no shadows or distortion, half the bots and particles, 30 FPS cap; lowers the resolution by itself if FPS < 25. On by default on phones (Settings → Graphics → \"Lite mode\"; or ?lite=1 / ?lite=0 in the link).":"弱机轻量模式：降低分辨率，无阴影和畸变，机器人和粒子减半，限制 30 FPS；FPS < 25 时自动降低分辨率。手机上默认开启（设置 → 图形 → “轻量模式”；或在链接中加 ?lite=1 / ?lite=0）。",
"Phone: new controls. Left — move, right — look (both sticks appear under your finger). Left thumb alone — \"auto\"; when the right one is used, the trooper fires by itself only while the crosshair is on an enemy. Tap an enemy — rocket or grenade, 2 taps — reflex, 3 taps — artillery strike. Auto reload. Jetpack — a button at the left edge. Bottom corners are free, minimap in the corner, hints can be closed with a cross, the objective can be collapsed. Old layout: Settings → Phone.":"手机：全新操作。左侧——移动，右侧——视角（两个摇杆都出现在手指下方）。仅用左拇指为“AUTO”模式；使用右手时，只有准星对准敌人，士兵才会自动开火。点击敌人——火箭或手雷，点击 2 次——反射，点击 3 次——炮击。自动换弹。喷气背包——左边缘的按钮。底部两角空出，小地图在角落，提示可用叉号关闭，目标可折叠。旧布局：设置 → 手机。",
"Possession: ":"-\t-",
"Strategist: troopers dropping to you — +{0} (−{1} ore)":"战略官：士兵正空投至你身边——+{0}（−{1} 矿石）",
"STRATEGIST'S MARK":"战略官标记",
"Troopers can build: E (phone: \"Enter\") at a friendly construction site — your trooper builds it, squadmates nearby help. If the engineers are busy, the strategist asks you for help — a \"BUILD SITE\" marker.":"士兵可以建造：在友方工地按 E（手机：“Enter”）——你的士兵会进行建造，附近的小队成员会协助。如果工程兵都在忙，战略官会请你帮忙——出现“建造点”标记。",
"Strategist marks: the strategist puts ⌖ on an enemy cluster near you — artillery hits it 8 s later and nearby friendly \"Grad\" MLRS fire a salvo. Your own artillery strike from strategy mode gets \"Grad\" support too.":"战略官标记：战略官在你附近的敌人集群上放置 ⌖——8 秒后炮击命中，附近友方“冰雹”火箭炮齐射一轮。你在战略模式中发起的炮击同样会获得“冰雹”支援。",
"Strategist order: finish the {0} ({1} m)":"战略官指令：完成{0}（{1} 米）",
