"Support for command points: 4 in battle (📡 on the phone) — supply drop, recon scan, \"Grad\" rocket strike, artillery at the crosshair. The strategist sees anomalies on the map only after a scan.":"指挥点支援：战斗中共 4 种（手机上的 📡）——空投补给、侦察扫描、“冰雹”火箭打击、准星处炮击。战略家只有在扫描后才能在地图上看到异常。",
"Builder limit {0}/{1} — a new one once a slot frees up":"工程兵上限 {0}/{1}——有空位后才能再造",
"Swarm. Squads within 70 m of the burrow (and selected ones), plus selected light/medium vehicles (Jackal, Hammer, Grad), go through the tunnel. Or: select and RMB/tap the burrow.":"蜂群。地洞 70 米内的小队（及选中的小队），以及选中的轻/中型载具（豺狼、重锤、冰雹）穿过隧道。或：选中后右键/点按地洞。",
"You play the Swarm: tunnel burrow, exit up to 220 m, dust warning, squads and vehicles through":"扮演蜂群：隧道地洞、220 米内出口、尘土预警、小队和载具穿隧道",
"Swarm: tunnels":"蜂群：隧道",
