"Bosses unlock at 12:00 (time is skipped here). A factory is required — it is already built. Builder → \"Build\" → the boss plant → LMB at the marker.":"首领在 12:00 解锁（此处已跳过时间）。需要工厂——已经建好。工程兵 →“建造”→ 首领工厂 → 在标记处左键。",
"Bosses unlock at 12:00 (skipped here). Builder → \"Build\" → the boss plant → tap the marker → \"Build\".":"首领在 12:00 解锁（此处已跳过）。工程兵 →“建造”→ 首领工厂 → 点按标记 →“建造”。",
