"Heavy power-armoured infantry, concrete barriers, repair and artillery. Slower but tougher.":"财团：身穿动力装甲的重步兵、混凝土路障、维修和炮兵。更慢但更耐打。",
"Live in the Green anomalous zone, drawn to crystal veins. Neutral until touched or approached; dangerous to both sides. Fire and napalm ×1.6.":"生活在绿色异常区，被水晶矿脉吸引。不触碰、不靠近就保持中立；对双方都有危险。火焰和燃烧弹 ×1.6。",
