"Engineer":"工程兵",
"Steel fluff stuck to you — corrodes armour −2/s. Stand still 3 s out of combat or find an engineer":"钢绒粘在你身上了——腐蚀装甲 −2/秒。脱战后原地站 3 秒，或去找工程兵",
