"Strategist → Commander → Shooter: one mode button (PC Tab/P, phone — top button, gamepad — View; hold to pick).":"战略家 → 指挥官 → 射手：一个模式按钮（电脑用 Tab/P，手机用顶部按钮，手柄用 View；按住可选择）。",
"Tilted camera over your squad: click to move, on an enemy to attack, 1–4 abilities, Tab next squad, double-click a trooper to dive into the shooter.":"俯视小队的倾斜镜头：点击移动，点击敌人攻击，1–4 技能，Tab 切换下一小队，双击士兵切入射手模式。",
"First-person combat as any trooper or vehicle. Jetpack, slide, grenade, rocket, reflex, artillery, rifle-butt melee.":"以任意士兵或载具进行第一人称战斗。喷气背包、滑铲、手雷、火箭、反应时间、炮击支援、枪托近战。",
"Fauna":"动物群",
"📖 Encyclopedia — ☰ → pause: units, bosses, anomalies":"📖 百科 — 在 ☰ 暂停菜单中：单位、首领、异常",
" (press ":"（再按一次",
"Factions play differently: the Swarm digs tunnels and regenerates, the Consortium builds barriers and repairs. From minute 12 — the Bastion and Reaper bosses; you can possess your own.":"阵营玩法各不相同：蜂群挖掘隧道并自我修复，财团修筑屏障并维修。从第12分钟起——堡垒和收割者首领登场；你可以附身自己的首领。",
"Fixes: the camera card hides under pause and menus, building labels are smaller and fainter, clean screen (F9/👁) also hides world markers.":"修复：暂停和菜单时隐藏镜头卡片，建筑标签更小更淡，简洁界面（F9/👁）现在也会隐藏世界标记。",
